From 35f03bdfd38c588051fe2fd1fe088d4358493d92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:59:49 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/34] Add the generated settings index

One entry per setting that has a control (2067), generated by
scripts/gen_search_index.py from the settings inventory. The text of an entry
is the KCM's own source string, translated at runtime with the KCM's domain.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
---
 app/settingsindex_p.h | 2087 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 2087 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 app/settingsindex_p.h

diff --git a/app/settingsindex_p.h b/app/settingsindex_p.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..abf432d
--- /dev/null
